    "SimpleX has no user accounts or servers — the agent talks to a local `simplex-chat` daemon over WebSocket. Start the daemon (e.g. `simplex-chat -p 5225`) and point the WebSocket URL at it. Leave 'Allowed Groups' empty to ignore group messages (safer default).": {},
