    "The bootstrap access token itself goes in `~/.hermes/.env` as the env var named above (default `BWS_ACCESS_TOKEN`) — never in config.yaml. Leave Server URL empty for US Cloud, use `https://vault.bitwarden.eu` for EU, or a self-hosted vault URL.": {
      "comment": "A description of the Bitwarden Secrets Manager bootstrap tab, including instructions on how to set up the access token.",
